# =========================================================
# TechCatalyst DE 2026 - .gitignore
# The student-facing GitHub repo is PUBLIC. Everything in the
# "Instructor-only" section below must never be pushed.
# =========================================================

# --- macOS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.$*.bkp
*.bkp
*.dtmp

# --- Python environments and caches ---
.venv/
**/.venv/
.venv-probes/
.venv-mlflow/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
.python-version
uv.lock

# --- Instructor-only (never push to the public student repo) ---
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
prompt.md
prompt_v2.md
.agents/
.claude/
.superpowers/
docs/
instructor_archive/
reference-material/
**/Instructor Notes/
**/Audits/
*Acceptance Report*
*Content_Review*
*_Audit_*
DE_2026.drawio
*.drawio.bkp

# --- Slide sources (push PDF exports in SlidesPDF/ instead) ---
Week 1/Slides/
Week 2/Slides/
Week 3/Slides/
Week 4/Slides/
Week 5/Slides/
Week 6/Slides/
Week 7/Slides/

# --- Credentials (never commit; rotate anything ever exposed) ---
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/snow.cfg
**/aws.cfg
**/cloud.cfg
*.pem
**/keys/
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
gcp-*.json

# --- Large installers / downloads ---
google-cloud-cli*

# --- Generated AutoML output (regenerated by running the notebook) ---
# W6D2 Activity 4 now writes under student-work/, which is ignored below,
# so no rule is needed here.
# **/automl_naive/
# **/automl_honest/

# --- Student work area (students manage their own repos) ---
student-work/

# --- Generated by running lab notebooks in place (students save to student-work/) ---
Week 7/Labs/Day 1/*.png
Week 7/Labs/Day 1/solutions/*.png
